# =============================================================================
# PROJECT HEDGE — NATS user credentials TEMPLATE for account: warm_ai
#
# DO NOT COMMIT REAL JWTs OR NKEY SEEDS. This file ships as a placeholder so
# the docker-compose volume mounts resolve. To mint real credentials run:
#
#   docker/nats/provision-creds.sh
#
# Account permissions enforced by `docker/nats/nats-server.conf`:
#   publish allow  : ai.>  mem.>  obs.>
#   publish DENY   : risk.>  exec.>  trader.>     (R21.3, R30.6 — non-negotiable)
#   subscribe      : md.>  sig.>  exec.>  pos.>  mem.>  ops.>  ai.>
#
# The deny list is enforced server-side. Even if a Warm_AI_Pipeline component
# is compromised and tries to publish `risk.decision.approved`, the NATS
# server rejects the publish and emits a permission-violation log entry
# consumable by the Self_Healing_Supervisor.
# =============================================================================

